/// # Bugs
///
/// In pre-V36, GiveUnit didn't check if you owned the unit.  A patch
/// for this was part of 1.3.1 SetPatch.  Fixed in V36.
///
/// # See Also
///
/// GetUnit()
@library("disk.resource")
extern pub fn GiveUnit()
